**Theorem (`allListChar_eq_one_iff`).** The characteristic value is one exactly when every finite condition encoded in its arguments holds.

*Proof.* Apply the conjunction-fold characterization with initial accumulator one. ∎

**Theorem (`allListChar_le_one`).** The characteristic function always takes a value at most one.

